flowchart TD
    N0([Check])
    N1(Retry queue)
    N2([Retry])
    N3(Report notify)
    N4(Notify)
    N5{Archive}
    N0 -->|ok| N1
    N0 --> N2
    N0 --> N3
    N1 -->|fail| N4
    N3 --> N5
    N2 --> N4
    N0 --> N4
    N2 --> N5
    N5 -->|again| N2
    N3 -.->|retry| N2
    N3 -.->|again| N2
